  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77aae82a246fbc49",
      "translationZh": "太长不看版：Hugging Face 官方 MCP 服务器为访问 Hub 的 AI 助手提供独特的自定义选项，还能通过一个简单的 URL 访问数千个 AI 应用。我们使用 MCP 的“Streamable HTTP”传输方式进行部署，并详细探讨了服务器开发者面临的各种权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94023b99a4263415",
      "translationZh": "过去一个月，我们在构建实用的 MCP 服务器方面学到了很多东西——我们将在这里讲述这段历程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6842f8089da04f1e",
      "translationZh": "Model Context Protocol（MCP，模型上下文协议）正在兑现其承诺，成为连接 AI 助手与外部世界的标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f44959cf645a7f2c",
      "translationZh": "在 Hugging Face，通过 MCP 提供对 Hub 的访问是一个显而易见的选择，本文将分享我们开发 hf.co/mcp MCP 服务器的经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a34c2181e3f0737",
      "translationZh": "设计选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267ed424d2560cd1",
      "translationZh": "社区使用 Hub 开展研究、开发、内容创作等活动。我们希望让人们能够根据自身需求自定义服务器，同时轻松访问 Spaces 上提供的数千个 AI 应用。这意味着需要通过即时调整用户的工具，让 MCP 服务器具备动态特性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c66d3f94a86e24a7",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face MCP 设置页面，用户可以在此配置自己的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc9e5e71589bce2c",
      "translationZh": "我们还希望避免复杂的下载和配置，让访问变得简单，因此必须能够通过一个简单的 URL 进行远程访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7e963ece980f6c5c",
      "translationZh": "远程服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06d50e41a2dfafc2",
      "translationZh": "构建远程 MCP 服务器时，首先要决定客户端如何连接到它。MCP 提供了多种传输选项，各有不同的取舍。简而言之：我们的开源代码支持所有变体，但在生产环境中，我们选择了最现代的一种。本节将详细介绍这些不同的选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2e7d6648fcc79ce",
      "translationZh": "自 2024 年 11 月推出以来，MCP 经历了快速演进，在 9 个月内进行了 3 次协议修订。在此期间，SSE 传输被 Streamable HTTP 取代，授权机制也被引入并重新设计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0357c5efdca400f0",
      "translationZh": "这些快速变化意味着，不同客户端应用对各项 MCP 功能及协议修订版本的支持程度各不相同，这给我们的设计选择带来了额外挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "748b269bbf4b22fe",
      "translationZh": "以下简要概述了 Model Context Protocol 及相关 SDK 提供的传输选项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aaead4abf5d0fd5e",
      "translationZh": "传输",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7525b1492fb848",
      "translationZh": "说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f789813ee1cc988",
      "translationZh": "通常用于 MCP 服务器与客户端运行在同一台计算机上的情况。需要时能够访问文件等本地资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "896a03d65e0eb6be",
      "translationZh": "HTTP 配合 SSE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26def5fa0c03bbea",
      "translationZh": "用于通过 HTTP 进行远程连接。已在 MCP 的 2025-03-26 版本中弃用，但仍在使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e885e4421e6a6afb",
      "translationZh": "可流式传输的 HTTP",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "159717707a3c52d1",
      "translationZh": "一种更灵活的远程 HTTP 传输方式，相比即将被取代的 SSE 版本，提供了更多部署选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8df1459dbea14211",
      "translationZh": "STDIO 和 HTTP with SSE 默认都是完全双向的——这意味着客户端和服务器保持连接打开，并且可以随时相互发送消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "603a692bd2adbc12",
      "translationZh": "SSE 指的是“Server Sent Events”（服务器发送事件）——这是一种让 HTTP 服务器保持连接打开，并发送事件以响应请求的方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "72c2d371fe269234",
      "translationZh": "理解 Streamable HTTP",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a6d724c1836cf60",
      "translationZh": "MCP 服务器开发者在配置 Streamable HTTP 传输时面临许多选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a15cb91cac9f07f1",
      "translationZh": "有 3 种主要通信模式可供选择：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9617dd5a577185b7",
      "translationZh": "直接响应——简单的请求/响应模式（类似于标准 REST API）。这非常适合简单搜索等直接、无状态的操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e015dbcc229599ea",
      "translationZh": "请求作用域流——与单个请求关联的临时 SSE 流。如果工具调用耗时较长，例如视频生成，这种模式就可用于发送进度更新。此外，服务器可能需要通过信息征询（Elicitation）向用户请求信息，或发起采样（Sampling）请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e124ccc49a452e1d",
      "translationZh": "服务器推送流——支持服务器主动发起消息的长连接 SSE。这可用于发送资源、工具和提示词列表的变更通知，或按需发起采样和信息征询。这些连接需要额外管理，例如保活以及重新连接时的恢复机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf74a375a7b23269",
      "translationZh": "通过官方 SDK 使用请求作用域流时，请使用 RequestHandlerExtra 参数（TypeScript）中提供的 sendNotification() 和 sendRequest() 方法，或设置 related_request_id（Python），以将消息发送到正确的流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf0e896da03df444",
      "translationZh": "另一个需要考虑的因素是，MCP 服务器本身是否需要为每个连接维护状态。这由服务器在客户端发送 Initialize 请求时决定：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0916a93b0a1776f",
      "translationZh": "无状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4ab48dc9497302d",
      "translationZh": "有状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1d05c5f5b689a4c",
      "translationZh": "会话 ID",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ccacf99fee1e017",
      "translationZh": "不需要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d621cfe0c161be7",
      "translationZh": "服务器在响应中返回 mcp-session-id",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eed88f3aa1edf2d6",
      "translationZh": "含义",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc41da5c0aab75e5",
      "translationZh": "每个请求都是独立的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdec349a8eb93b91",
      "translationZh": "服务器维护客户端上下文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1766cc4ec8d9f77",
      "translationZh": "扩展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "869a8c8690ee4968",
      "translationZh": "简单的水平扩展：任何实例都可以处理任何请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1956fd87efc1c70b",
      "translationZh": "需要会话亲和性或共享状态机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6aa691282021ec5",
      "translationZh": "恢复",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ccacf99fee1e017",
      "translationZh": "不需要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e45d2e213d0be4b",
      "translationZh": "可能会为中断的连接重放消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14a58abe4631726e",
      "translationZh": "下表汇总了 MCP 功能及其支持的通信模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7ab0ecb2ab2c762",
      "translationZh": "MCP 功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5cfd37013c40f4c",
      "translationZh": "服务器推送",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1204af20e0516f6",
      "translationZh": "请求作用域",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65c1088de609536b",
      "translationZh": "直接响应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3d2a068599bc992",
      "translationZh": "工具、提示词、资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f5384d58bcb1bb",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f5384d58bcb1bb",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f5384d58bcb1bb",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a4d992c77700fa5",
      "translationZh": "采样/信息征询",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0810f0775fb86c21",
      "translationZh": "服务器可随时发起",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c75d14769238ff7",
      "translationZh": "与客户端发起的请求相关",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce86a6ae65d3692",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "099ab1918f411566",
      "translationZh": "资源订阅",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f5384d58bcb1bb",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce86a6ae65d3692",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce86a6ae65d3692",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cab152287a9b726",
      "translationZh": "工具/提示词列表变更",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f5384d58bcb1bb",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce86a6ae65d3692",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce86a6ae65d3692",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58ba00d6855ac06e",
      "translationZh": "工具进度通知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f5384d58bcb1bb",
      "translationZh": "是",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce86a6ae65d3692",
      "translationZh": "否",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d22108c0c58fa2e",
      "translationZh": "使用请求作用域流时，采样和信息征询请求需要有状态连接，以便使用 mcp-session-id 进行响应关联。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c16e7a1cba6704c",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face MCP Server 是开源的，支持在直接响应和服务器推送两种模式下通过 STDIO、SSE 和 Streamable HTTP 部署。使用服务器推送流时，你可以配置连接保活超时和最后活动超时。此外，它还内置了一个可观测性仪表板，你可以用它了解不同客户端如何管理连接，以及如何处理工具列表变更通知。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a96db853cc81b4fe",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了我们的 MCP Server 连接仪表板，它正以“服务器推送”Streamable HTTP 模式运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51baf86e5eb7561f",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face MCP Server 连接仪表板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c697714dd5573f0f",
      "translationZh": "生产环境部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba3e5890d9e60837",
      "translationZh": "在生产环境中，我们决定以无状态、直接响应的配置，使用 Streamable HTTP 启动 MCP Server，原因如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c51e3a445a2332da",
      "translationZh": "无状态：对于匿名用户，我们提供一套用于使用 Hub 的标准工具，以及一个图像生成器。对于已认证用户，我们的状态包括他们选定的工具和 Gradio 应用。我们还会确保用户的 ZeroGPU 配额正确应用于其账户。这通过所提供的 HF_TOKEN 或我们在收到请求时查询的 OAuth 凭据来管理。我们现有的工具都不要求我们在请求之间维护任何其他状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "966eab860656ed74",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 MCP Server 的 URL 后添加 ?login 来使用 OAuth 登录，例如 https://huggingface.co/mcp?login。一旦 claude.ai 的远程集成支持最新的 OAuth 规范，我们可能会将其设为默认方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "626d1d4803b61177",
      "translationZh": "直接响应的部署资源开销最低，而且我们目前没有任何工具需要在执行期间进行采样或信息征询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5c18ff85f692c04",
      "translationZh": "未来支持：发布时，“HTTP with SSE”传输方式仍是许多 MCP 客户端的默认远程传输方式。不过，由于它即将被弃用，我们不想在管理它上投入过多精力。幸运的是，一些热门客户端（VSCode 和 Cursor）已经开始切换，而且在发布后的一周内，claude.ai 也添加了支持。如果你需要通过 SSE 连接，可以自行在 FreeCPU Hugging Face Space 上部署一份我们的服务器副本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1d87df7303be7a7f",
      "translationZh": "工具列表变更通知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55f1071dc0301f50",
      "translationZh": "未来，我们希望在用户更新 Hub 上的设置时，支持实时发送工具列表变更通知。不过，这会带来几个实际问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fa79dd812bbb350",
      "translationZh": "首先，用户往往会在客户端中配置自己喜欢的 MCP 服务器，并让它们保持启用状态。这意味着，只要应用程序开着，客户端就会一直保持连接。要发送通知，就得为当前每个活跃的客户端维持一个开放连接——无论它们是否正在被使用——仅仅是为了应对用户可能更新工具配置的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f63fb2807892f735",
      "translationZh": "其次，大多数 MCP 服务器和客户端在闲置一段时间后都会断开连接，并在需要时恢复连接。这不可避免地意味着即时推送通知会被错过，因为通知通道届时已经关闭。实际上，让客户端按需刷新连接和工具列表要简单得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64c1a22d85a2fe97",
      "translationZh": "除非你能对客户端和服务器两端进行合理的控制，否则，在已有资源消耗更低的工具列表刷新方案的情况下，使用服务器推送流会给公共部署增加大量复杂性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f8cd7b1ab74c8e4",
      "translationZh": "URL 用户体验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12fa50d12838e0ef",
      "translationZh": "就在上线前，@julien-c 提交了一个 PR，为访问 hf.co/mcp 的用户提供友好的说明。这极大地改善了用户体验——否则，默认响应就只是一段不太友好的 JSON。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a53caef9c8d1a456",
      "translationZh": "起初，我们发现这产生了极大的流量。经过一番调查，我们发现，当返回的是网页而不是 HTTP 405 错误时，VSCode 会每秒多次轮询该端点！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bb533751e8694ae",
      "translationZh": "@coyotte508 建议的修复方法是正确识别浏览器，并且仅在这种情况下返回页面。也感谢 VSCode 团队迅速修复了这个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20571c16ecf9e350",
      "translationZh": "尽管没有明确说明，但以这种方式返回页面似乎确实是 MCP 规范所允许的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "979d1281c9a3d68a",
      "translationZh": "MCP 客户端行为",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc69477983f83622",
      "translationZh": "MCP 协议会在初始化期间发送多个请求。典型的连接顺序是：Initialize、Notifications/Initialize、tools/list，然后是 prompts/list。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d20c5bc68d768195",
      "translationZh": "考虑到 MCP 客户端在保持打开期间会连接和重新连接，以及用户会定期发起调用，我们发现，每次工具调用大约对应 100 条 MCP 控制消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640779a9bcbbb62c",
      "translationZh": "某些客户端还会发送一些对我们的无状态、直接响应配置而言没有意义的请求，例如 Ping、取消请求，或尝试列出资源（我们目前并未声明支持这项能力）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38a7e285b41c9a67",
      "translationZh": "2025 年 7 月的第一周，访问我们服务器的不同客户端数量达到了惊人的 164 个。有趣的是，最受欢迎的工具之一是 mcp-remote。大约一半的客户端将它用作连接我们远程服务器的桥梁。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ccb0f564830280b",
      "translationZh": "MCP 正在快速发展，过去几个月里，聊天应用、IDE、智能体和 MCP 服务器等领域已经取得了诸多成果，对此我们深感振奋。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e209d8dcfd869e6a",
      "translationZh": "我们已经看到了集成 Hugging Face Hub 所带来的强大能力，而现在，对 Gradio Spaces 的支持使得通过最新的机器学习应用轻松扩展 LLM 的能力成为可能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e735efaf87919567",
      "translationZh": "以下是迄今为止人们使用我们的 MCP 服务器所做的一些出色示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba7fc2d1eb49526c",
      "translationZh": "编排视频制作流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44d3a75bd7c06b3f",
      "translationZh": "图像编辑",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "396292a956808983",
      "translationZh": "文档搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "265cf1bb21df9ae8",
      "translationZh": "AI 应用开发",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51ccc5d2190a3079",
      "translationZh": "为现有模型添加推理能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70e047af7bfa4d01",
      "translationZh": "我们希望本文能帮助你深入理解构建远程 MCP 服务器时需要做出的决策，也鼓励你在自己喜爱的 MCP 客户端中尝试其中的一些示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90650c55ca12b9c1",
      "translationZh": "欢迎查看我们的开源 MCP 服务器，并使用你的客户端尝试不同的传输选项；你也可以提交 Issue 或 Pull Request，以进行改进或提出新功能建议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a42d95fceb2dc9d5",
      "translationZh": "欢迎在此讨论帖中告诉我们你的想法、反馈和问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
